  "question": {
    "text": "The shortest wavelength of the Brackett series of a hydrogen like atom (Atomic number <math> <mrow> <mo>=</mo><mi>Z</mi></mrow> </math>) is the same as the shortest wavelength of the Balmer series of hydrogen atom. The value of <math> <mi>Z</mi> </math> is"
