  "solution": {
    "text": "Shortest wavelength corresponds to maximum energy therefore transitions are from infinity to <math> <mrow>  <mi>n</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>4</mn></mrow></math> and <math> <mrow>  <mi>n</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>2</mn></mrow></math> respectively.<br /><br /><math><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><msup><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">Z</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msup></mrow></mfenced><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mfrac><mrow><mn>13.6</mn></mrow><mrow><mn>16</mn></mrow></mfrac></mrow></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mfrac><mrow><mn>13.6</mn></mrow><mrow><mn>4</mn></mrow></mfrac></mrow></mfenced></math><br /><br /><math><msup><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">Z</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msup><mo>=</mo><mn>4</mn></math> or <math><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">Z</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>2</mn></math>"
  }
